ad been acting as part of her role as a double agent. He then attacked the Huntik team downstairs with his [[Redcap]] but he and Klaus' forces were held off by [[Dante Vale]]'s Titans. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}","text":"This Suit attempted to stop Sophie Casterwill and Zhalia Moon from reaching the lower level of Klaus' bookshop, alongside his Bonelasher and Unnamed Suit 038. Zhalia held the pair off, giving the Sophie time to get past them. Afterwards, the Suits and Zhalia left on good terms as Zhalia had been acting as part of her role as a double agent. He then attacked the Huntik team downstairs with his Redcap but he and Klaus' forces were held off by Dante Vale's Titans. [The Bookshop Hunter]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"* Augerfrost"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Bonelasher]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"* Bonelasher\n* Redcap"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 039 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Vienna, Austria, under Klaus.\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit attempted to stop Sophie Casterwill and Zhalia Moon from reaching the lower level of Klaus' bookshop, alongside his Bonelasher and Unnamed Suit 038. Zhalia held the pair off, giving the Sophie time to get past them. Afterwards, the Suits and Zhalia left on good terms as Zhalia had been acting as part of her role as a double agent. He then attacked the Huntik team downstairs with his Redcap but he and Klaus' forces were held off by Dante Vale's Titans. [The Bookshop Hunter]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* Augerfrost\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* Bonelasher\n* Redcap","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:Unnamed Suit 039.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Vienna, Austria]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[The Bookshop Hunter]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Blonde\n| eyes      = \n| va        = \n}}'''Unnamed Suit 039''' is a [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]]. He operates from  [[Vienna, Austria]], under [[Klaus]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit attempted to stop [[Sophie Casterwill]] and [[Zhalia Moon]] from reaching the lower level of [[Klaus' bookshop]], alongside his [[Bonelasher]] and [[Unnamed Suit 038]]. Zhalia held the pair off, giving the Sophie time to get past them. Afterwards, the Suits and Zhalia left on good terms as Zhalia had been acting as part of her role as a double agent. He then attacked the Huntik team downstairs with his [[Redcap]] but he and Klaus' forces were held off by [[Dante Vale]]'s Titans. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Bonelasher]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_id":"huntik:page:8234","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.